<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <EnableNETAnalyzers>true</EnableNETAnalyzers>
    <AnalysisLevel>latest-recommended</AnalysisLevel>
    <ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>true</ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>
    <Authors>Aramis Enterprise Solutions</Authors>
    <Product>WorkMate 2.0</Product>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!--
    ================================================================================
    TEMPORARY. Five advisories against SixLabors.ImageSharp 3.1.11, suppressed one
    by one. Recorded in docs/adr/0013-imagesharp-advisories-suppressed.md, which
    carries the exposure assessment and the review trigger.

    MUST BE RESOLVED BEFORE ANY PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT. ImageSharp is a transitive
    dependency of OrchardCore.Media, which resizes user-uploaded images — on this
    product that means employee photographs and the attachments on an employee's
    documents section, so the untrusted input these advisories are about is input
    the product deliberately accepts. There is no fixed 3.1.x to move to and 4.x is
    unverified against OrchardCore.Media 3.0.1.

    Each entry is a single advisory URL, deliberately. NuGetAudit stays ON, every
    other package stays audited, and a sixth advisory against ImageSharp — or any
    advisory against anything else — still fails the build, which is the whole
    point of suppressing by id rather than by package or by severity.

    Removing an entry is how this ends: when Orchard ships a patch that moves off
    3.1.11, or a 4.x override is verified, delete the matching line and watch the
    build stay green.
    ================================================================================
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Moderate -->
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-gwg2-r3hj-4w44" />
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wmxv-xphr-5c9g" />
    <!-- High -->
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-j3p4-wp97-rph4" />
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-j9gm-c75j-xc9q" />
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-jjfr-hcj7-qf5w" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
